@startuml
' SSD – UC-11: Seller Dashboard
title SSD – UC-11: Seller Dashboard

actor "Seller" as Seller
participant "SmartTech System" as System

== Load Dashboard ==

Seller -> System: 1: loadDashboard()
activate System

System -> System: 2: getSalesOverview(sellerId, period='30days')
System -> System: 3: calculateMetrics(totalSales, orderCount, avgOrderValue)
System -> System: 4: getActiveListingsCount(sellerId)
System -> System: 5: getPendingOrdersCount(sellerId)
System -> System: 6: getRevenueChartData(sellerId, daily/weekly/monthly)
System --> Seller: 7: returnDashboardData(metrics, chartData, recentOrders[])

== Refresh Dashboard ==

Seller -> System: 8: refreshDashboard()
System --> Seller: 9: returnUpdatedMetrics()

deactivate System

@enduml